<title>JAPAN: Toshiba - 96/97 group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Toshiba - 96/97 group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.45 trln	 vs	    5.12 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  154.25		vs	  220.22</p>
<p> Pretax	     125.46		vs	  177.75</p>
<p> Net		   67.08		vs	   90.39</p>
<p> EPS		   20.06 yen	  vs	   26.85 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toshiba Corp is a leading electric machinery maker.</p>
<p>(Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
